{"id":"wb-4-242","name":"八路军一二九师司令部旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"八路军一二九师司令部旧址","text":"八路军一二九师司令部旧址，又名刘邓大军司令部旧址、129师司令部旧址，位于河北省邯郸市涉县河南店镇赤岸村，由将军岭、129师司令部、和129师陈列馆组成，面积340亩。是中国重点文物保护单位、中国4A级旅游景区。刘邓129师司令部共有三个北方风格四合院构成，存有刘伯承故居、邓小平故居及其宿办室，下院有刘伯承、邓小平、李达种的紫荆树。第二次国共内战时期，刘、邓两人在这里战斗八年。在抗战中创建晋冀鲁豫边区抗日根据地。129师司令部又被称为中共“第二代领导发祥地”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AB%E8%B7%AF%E5%86%9B%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%9D%E5%B8%88%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%A4%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93855703,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93855703","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2df60febbfe305855321e723.jpg","title":"一二九师司令部旧址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%9D%E5%B8%88%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%A4%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%9D%E5%B8%88%E5%8F%B8%E4%BB%A4%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"B0dhiYar42","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​一二九师司令部旧址","width":320,"height":228}}